      "writtenOn": "2023-08-29T14:41:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "When we exit early on a failure, later GPIO pins may have success in configuring which are used in tests.  Tests still expect these pins to be successfully configured but now using them causes an assert.  All board specific tests have 100% failure with early return.  I agree this \"keep going on error\" is not a great, but I think there\u0027s a large effort to fix tests to make this work.  I can add a TODO and file a bug for this?",
      "parentUuid": "a3032a7f_86bd3c2f",
      "revId": "1fdf2f640efc2b96da5ce780e3fc3ffe2f2aff37",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
